# Panfrost bring-up candidate: the accepted baseline's substrate plus the GPU
# at one fixed operating point.  Built from mainlineNixosGpuBundle with
# linux-gemini overridden to claude/gpu-fixed-opp-overlay-20260903
# (c5081a1724d82a20998d70a957e06de79320ee81), which adds the previously missing
# mt6797-gemini-pda-gpu-fixed-opp overlay.
#
# This profile deliberately drops touchscreen/FGADC activation: those flags mark
# the accepted full-NixOS baseline, which asserts a negative contract that the
# GPU stays disabled.  A GPU bring-up therefore sits beside that baseline.
#
# Composed-DT acceptance already verified offline: /gpu@13040000 okay,
# /gpu-opp-table/opp-500500000 at 0x1dd50620 Hz / 975000 uV, and the RT5735 vgpu
# rail clamped min == max == 975000 uV with regulator-boot-on, so neither the
# MFG clock nor the rail can move during the first bind.  All ten CPU nodes keep
# clock-frequency, so LK cannot freeze in its CPU fixup loop.
#
# The Stage2 store is byte-identical to the accepted baseline's and is already
# resident on p29, so this transaction installs p22 only.
